<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="toc1">HEBREW Mi-ngaidiang Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrew</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt1">HEBREW</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Hebrew larik hi</char> Inzootna Maruo ah Pathian chongleiril ngai katamkhat kha Jisu'n huui mintung kha malarra malung masokna chemajia eii. Hiwahi chongpui inkhat angnga injia. Hebrew suungnga angtho thoa Jisu'n Pathian chongleiril kha huui mintungme khat-um Jihudi Thiampu Kalian chuontho ngai jarra Inzootna Maruo chongmun 60 chungtiang inthiangtak-ah amalar. Hiwa jarra hiwa larik hin Jihudi Christian ngai malung masokna ajar inkhat kha eii. Jisu'n angtho-thoa dan kha puimintungme halli thiampu ngai'n woikhat inlet-ah dooiphur ngaihi penunujei tijarra Hebrew in amalarjei. Jisu'n manu rakip sik-ah na-inphal piya nathipijei, halli woikhat bit ithi khan apha rakip sik-ah ejei. Eini Pathian kangamna sik-ah rahoi kanamasuok Jisu Christa nukjuili amadiang ngamnachak nasik Hebrew ngai diangnga chemajia hin awini eini pha-ah Christian ngai innum malung masokna kha nimu (12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tu-inkhat innum Hebrew hi tu imajiame jetmu takkha kasing-kathei ngai'n Tirton Paul, Luke emakli Barnabas lei-echa tia ngamna inda. Hiwa inmajiana apha um jetmu takkha hiwahi Christa inneisuonuk kum 70 tungmadet inleimajia lei-ete tia katam khat in inngamna. Jerusalem hi 70 AD ah inmakoi, takkha hiwa larik kamajiapa in Jerusalem jarra aril pha khawa kha lakakoimak angnga aril, Hebrew hi Rome khuopuiya inleimajia eii (13:24) halli koisuok katamkhat karra insem lei-ete.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Injiapa in amalar khachu Jisu hi Pathian chongkachoi ngai khat-um marwaan tirton ngai neek-ah alok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:1-4:13">1:1–4:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Injiapa in anuoikata ah amalar khachu Jisu hi Jerusalem Pathian biak-inn suungnga sepakatho thiampu ngai neek-ah alok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14–7:28</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pathian in Moses diangnga ileipeii dan dungjuiya Pathian in ama mi ngaile inzootna maruo ileida khaneek-ah Jisu chuontho in alok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 8:1-10:31">8:1–10:31</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Jisu hi alam rakip ah kalokkhet eii tia arilcheen suonuk, kamajiapa'n chuon tak-ah thosik minchuna katamtak aleipeii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 10:32-13:17">10:32–13:17</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ahekna-ah kamajiapa in malung masokna khat-um minpaakna chong lekkhat majia-ah larik hi aminhek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:18-25">13:18-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Asapa diangnga inphut Pathian chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Tiallaichu, Pathian chongkachoi ngai diangnga inphut amun angjet khat-um alam angjet-ah Pathian in nipi-nipu ngaidiang aleiril, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>takkha hiwa ajuohekna nikhuoni ngai hinchu Asapa diangnga inphut eini na-inbiak puijei. Pathian in Asapa diangnga inphut nuoipilchung hi abool, halli ahekna-ah Pathian in ikadang ama kha angrakip mapu amin ejei. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ama'n Pathian poina ra-ang kha ejei, halli Pathian tak omchan rathuul kha ama ejei, ama ranak neina chong khan manmasituol pumpui mahuumma aleida. Miring rakip manu ngai ngaidamna apesuoli, Ranak Kaneikhet Pathian changtiang marwaan khan ama in-ongjei.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Sapa lokna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Sapa kha marwaan tirton ngai neek-ah aminlok, halli Pathian in inmani ngai diangnga ipe raming neek-ah kalok kha amadiang apejei. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Ajarchu Pathian in ama marwaan tirton ngai inkhattak diang-um,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nang Kasapa na-eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">awini kei Napa ka-ejei.” leitimak.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Emakli Pathian in marwaan tirton inkhattak diang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Kei ama Pa ka-esik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">halli ama Kasapa esik eii,” timak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Khang 17:13</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Takkha Pathian in Asapa salutir kha nuoipilchungnga ajuotir siktiang, ama'n ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Pathian marwaan tirton rakip in ama kha chubei inthosik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Innidan 32:43</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Takkha Pathian in marwaan tirton ngai jarra hintia aril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Pathian in ama marwaan tirton ngaikha ratha ngai amin-eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">khat-um ama suok ngaikha meimachuon amin-eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Minpkla 104:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Takkha Pathian in Sapa jarra hintia aril:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Narengram kha, E Pathian, hektik-kaboi esik eii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Nang in nami ngai chungnga katuunna wai naroonsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 45:6">Minpkla 45:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Nang in katuun kha namanuom halli katuunmak kha namatir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Khawajarra Pathian, Napathian in nang kha anakadangjei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">halli nasap ngai diangnga ipekha neek-ah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">kheella kayana kalok kahoi kha nangdiang anapejei.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Ama innum aril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Pumi, nang in, inphutna-ah nuoipil nabool,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">halli nakuttak in marwaan ngaikha nabool. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Minpkla 102:25-27</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Inmani rakip lamangsik eii, takkha nangchu mangnutin jei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">inmani rakip kha puondiar ngai angnga amaruosik eii.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Nang in inmani kha songkol inchuol angnga nathepsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">halli inmani kha puondiar angnga inthuulsik eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Takkha nang chu pha rakip-ah inthuul makche,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">halli naringkhuo um angtikniteii heknuni.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Pathian in ama marwaan tirton ngai inkhattak diang:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Kei'n nangni inhalpui ngaikha nakeii nuoiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">naketouna kamin emak laiseng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kachangtiang hin in-ongro” leitimak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Hanle, marwaan tirton ngai ang in-eme? Inmani ngaihi Pathian sepa katho halli sanminringna kamusik ngai kasansik ah ama'n ijuotir ratha ngaikha in-eii.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Sanminringna Kalok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Khawajarra eini anakeisuo maknasik, nijetjei akatuun rakip kha kacheet doomma nimahuumsik ejei. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Marwaan tirton ngai'n eini nipi-nipu ngai diangnga inleipeii chongpui kha adik tia inlar, halli hiwa chong kajuimak li karangaimak inmani'n rahoikasuok rachaakna kha inmu. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Khawajarra hituk-ah sanminringna kalok inkhat kha eini'n iteiiya ningaidon mak inchu, eini angtho thoa nitaan matorsik me? Pumi apumtak in mansakhet-ah sanminringna hi arilsuokjei, halli ama iril kajet ngaikhan einidiang khawakha adik tia inrilcheen. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Khawapha takkhan Pathian in ama sakhi ngaikha chuon-inlak khat-um ngakkaom rakip ngai inthona khan inmani diang athunpidel halli ama lungdou dungjuiya Ratha Inthiang kutchoi ngaikha aleisempi.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanminringna ah eini Lamkakeipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Eini'n nirilla niom akahongsik akathar manmasituol waikaroon sik-ah marwaan tirton ngaikha Pathian in ida emak. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Khawa rathuulla, Chong-inthiang munkhat-ah hintia aril:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“E Pathian, miring ngaihi ang in-eyame nang in inmani ngaisik hituk ni-ngaidonpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">miring ngaihi ang in-eyame nang in inmani ngai ni-ensui? <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Minpkla 8:4-6</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Nang in inmanikha marwaan tirton ngai neek-ah lekkhat katadet-ah nabool;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">nang in lurna khat-um kayana kha inmani naminkhu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript katam khat ah nang ibool rakip chungnga inmani wai naminroon iti chong inthundel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(enru minpakla 8:6)</char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>halli inmani kha angrakip chungnga waikaroon namin eii.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Hinthoa ati khachu Pathian in “angrakip chungnga waikaroon sik”; inmani kha abool, hiwahin angrakip inthiangnga incheljei. Takkha miring ngai'n tuunhin angrakip chungnga wai inroon chu eini'n lamumakmi. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Jisu hi aphakhat sik bit-ah marwaan tirton ngai neek-ah matadet-ah ida kha eini'n nimu. Khachu Pathian riangwai jarra miring rakip sik-ah ama'n anathipijei, thina kha aleidei jarra kajana le lurna renglukhu inkhu ama kha tuunchu eini'n nimujei. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Sapa katamtak in ama lurna kha inchang theinasik angrakip kabool khat-um kada Pathian bit in matorna aneiya, Jisu poongna khan pui mintungjei. Khawajarra Jisu kha inmani ngai sanminringna sik lamkakeipa kha eii.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Ama'n mi ngaikha inmanuwa inphut aminthiang, halli i-minthiang rakip ngaile Pa inkhat bit innei suomjei. Khawajarra Jisu'n inmani kha ama innsuungmi eii tia kakoisik injakmak. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Ama'n Pathian diang ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Kei'n kami ngaidiang angme nang in nitho kha karilsik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Kei'n inmani ngai intuupna khan kanaminpaak sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Minpkla 22:22</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Ama'n hi-um aril, “Kei'n Pathian diang ka-inngamnasik eii.” Halli ama'n hi-um arilnok, “Pathian in kei diangnga inape naipang ngaile Kei hin kaom.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Isa 8:17</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:18">18</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Takkha miring taksa khat-um thisen karoon mi ngaikha ama'n inmani kha naipang ngai tia ileikoi angnga, Jisu amatak um inmani kapuo inkhat hong eya, miring omchan ahonglei. Halli athina jarra ama'n thina chungnga ranak kanei Seitan kha aminmang thei nasik hiwahi ama'n itho eii, <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>halli thina kha inchi jarra inringkhuo ah suok kachang ngaiseng kha hinthoa amasuojei.<verse eid="HEB 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Ajarchu hiwahi inthiang eii khachu ama'n marwaan tirton ngaikha isan emak. Khawa rathuulla, Abraham tu-suon ngaikha ama'n isan eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa 41:8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 41:9">9</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Hiwa tinachu mi ngai manu ngaikha rangaimidam nasik, ama'n Pathian sepa thona-ah Thiampu kaliankhet minriang kasip le ngamna kaom enasik, alam rakip ah ama mi ngaile in-angnasik eii. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Halli ama tak-um matheemna alei-intongpui halli poongraalna kha aleidei, khawajarra tuunchu matheemna ah kachul ngaikha ama'n asan matorjei.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Moses neek-ah Jisu Alok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Pathian in ikoi, Christian ulenai ngai! Pathian ijuotir Thiampu Kaliankhet ningamna-ah nirilsuok Jisu kha eini'n ngaidonru.<verse eid="HEB 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Pathian innsuung pumpui sik-ah Moses kha achuon katho ngamna kaom angnga ama chuon katho sik-ah kakadangpa Pathian diang Jisu hi ngamna kaom eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Teelna 12:7</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Innkasak mi inkhat kha khawa inn kha neek-ah khoya intho angnga, khawa angnga Moses neek-ah Jisu kha kheella khoya thosik rahoi asuok. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Inn rakip hi, tu ka-ang mi inkhat in isak eii, takkha angrakip ngai kabool chu Pathian kha eii. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Pathian innsuungnga Moses hi suok inkhat eya ngamna kaom alei eii, halli Pathian in nuktiangnga arilsik ngaikha ama'n aleiril. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Takkha Sapa khan Pathian innsuung iroon angnga Christa hi ngamna kaom kha eii. Eini ningaidonna khan kacheet-ah inngamna khat-um ni-in-orpuiya ahekna katung nimahuum inchu, eini ama innsuung mi kha ni-ejei.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Mi ngai Soongmachumna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Ajarchu, Ratha Inthiang in iril angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Awini nangni'n Pathian rasa ningjet inchu,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>ningpi-ningpu ngai'n Pathian inhalpui angnga, malung minngar maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">inmani'n khawani neelramma ama kha in-ensin angnga.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Khawa khan inmani'n kum soommili kachuontho inmu innum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kei hi ensuinale enminna innaleinei, Pathian in ati.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Khawajarra kei'n khawa mi ngai chungnga karaangnga kati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Inmani'n apha rakip-ah kayana naneimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">halli kei kachongpeii ngaikha juimu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Kei karaang halli chong-inkhitna inkhat kaneijei:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Kei'n inmani diang kapesik soongmachumna ramkhan inmani'n angtikniteii luutkhai marasu!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Minpkla 95:7-11</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ulenai ngai, akaring Pathianna inphut nangni tu inkhat nuktiang kirmak nasik, khatuk malung kathamak khat-um kangamnamak nangni karra ommak nasik insingtheiru. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Khawa rathuulla, ning karra tu inkhat um manu matheemna khan ningchulmak nasikle malung kangar ninghong emak nasik, “Awini” inti nikhuo hi omlaiseng nangni inkhatli inkhat nisuo-ah insanru. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Ajarchu eini'n inphutni makheiya ninngamna kha ahekni katung kacheet-ah ninmahuum tit inchu, eini niraya-ah Christa le tum kachangsuom ngaikha ni-ejei.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Chong-inthiang iril kha hi eii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Awini nangni'n Pathian rasa ningjet inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ningpi-ningpu ngai'n Pathian inhalpui angnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">malung minngar maru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Minpkla 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Pathian rasa kajet-ah ama inhalpui mi ngaikha tu ngaime? Moses in Egypt makheiya iheiruoi inmani rakip ngaikha in-eii. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Kum soommili Pathian in iraangpui ngaikha tu ngai khame? Manu inthoa neelramma kathi mi ngaikha in-eii. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Pathian in ama chong-inkhitna anei phakhan, “Inmani'n angtikniteii kei'n inmani diang kapesik soongmachumna ram kha hongluut theinunu”—iti kha tu ngai diangnga irilme? Tu ka-ang chongkajuimak ngai diangnga iril eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Teelna 14:1-35</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Inmani'n inngamnamu jarra khawa ramkha leiluut matormu, tihi eini'n nimu.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Tuunchu ama'n ileiril soongmachumna kha eini'n nimu nasik Pathian in einidiang chong-inkhitna kha anapejei. Khawa soongmachumna chong-inkhitna kha nangni tu ka-ang inkhat innum muleiya ommak nasik, eini insingthei inlang omrui. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Ajarchu inmani'n inleijet angnga, eini innum Chongkahoi kha nijetjei. Inmani'n chongkha inleijet, takkha inmanisik khawa kha anemna leiommak, ajarchu inmani'n khawa injet phakhan ngamnale inruoiya leiralaangmu. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Eini akangamna ngai'n Pathian chong-inkhitna soongmachumna kha nimujei. Ama ileiti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Kei karaangnga chong-inkhitna inkhat kaneijei:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Inmani'n angtikniteii kei'n inmani diang kipe soongmachumna ramkha hongluut theinunu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ama'n nuoipilchung aboolni makheiya inphut achuon minhek innum hiwahi iril eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Minpkla 95:11</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Ajarchu nisari huuina jarra Chong-inthiang munkhat ah hiwahi aril: “Pathian in achuon rakip-ah inphut nisari huuini soong machum.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Inphut 2:2</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Hiwa jartak hi aril nook-ah: “Inmani'n angtikniteii kei'n inmani diang kapesik soongmachumna ram kha luutnunu.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Minpkla 95:11</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Tu ka-ang mansakhet-ah Chongkahoi kajet ngaikhan inngamnamak jarra soongmachumna kha ralaangmu, khawa soongmachumna kha kamusik izootpi lekkhatchu inom.<verse eid="HEB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Hiwa malaarna khachu, “Awini,” inti nikhuo inkhat kha Pathian in inthiangnga aminsuuk ah ida eii. Kum angjet suoa ama'n Chong-inthiangnga kaom kha aleiya David diangnga ileiril kha angnga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Awini nangni'n Pathian rasa ningjet inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">malung minngar maru.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Minpkla 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Joshua in Pathian chong-inkhitna soongmachum kha mi ngaidiang aleipe inchu, Pathian in leiilak nikhuo jarra rilkhainuni jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Innidan 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Josh 22:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Khawa e-innum, nisari huuini Pathian in soong machum angnga, Pathian mi ngai soongmachum nasik alakaom eii.<verse eid="HEB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Ajarchu Pathian in ama chuonna inphut soong machum angnga, tu ka-ang in Pathian soongmachumna kamu ngaikhan inchuonna inphut soong inmachumsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Inphut 2:2</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Khawajarra soongmachumna kha nimunasik eini'n akatha kha thorui, inmani inngamna asiin jarra inluutmak angnga eini tu inkhat um kaluutmak emui.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Ajarchu Pathian chong kha akaringchak le chuon kathochak, chemriam inni indou neek-ah kangei, ratha li malung inchunna, ru le ruthing injomna katung inthuuk ah ka-aat mator. Halli malung ngaidonna le manuomna ngaikha akathenkhoi mator kha eii. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Pathian diangnga inthup matorsik iteii ommak; ibool rakip ama maikuungnga inlar khat-um inlongnga kaom eii. Halli amadiang eini rakip nipumtak-ah nitho chuon jarkha nilape ngersik eii.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thiampu Kaliankhet eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Khawajarra eini'n nirilsuok ngamna kha kacheet-ah ma-ourui. Ajarchu Thiampu Kaliankhet inkhat Pathian omna katung kasi Jisu, Pathian Sapa kha eini'n ninei. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Eini Thiampu Kaliankhet khan eini nisuolna ngaikha kanajetpimak kha emak. Khattiang nitili, eini angnga alam rakip-ah matheemna intongpui, takkha manu kathomak, Thiampu Kaliankhet inkhat kha eini'n ninei. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Khawajarra riangwai omna, Pathian reng in-ongna munkhan kachi omleiya nairui. Khawakhan eini'n minriang kha nimusik eii khat-um eini sik-ah arei ompha eini kanasansik ah riangwai kha nimusik eii.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Ajarchu thiampu kaliankhet rakip hi, inmani rathuulla Pathian sepa kathosik, kutchoi ngai kapesik khat-um manu dooiphur ngai kape sik-ah inmani karra inkadang eii. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Ama tak-um alam angjet ah asuol jarra, kamo li akamasial ngaidiang ama malung kadaiya inbiakpui mator.<verse eid="HEB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Halli ama tak-um asuol jarra, mi ngai manu dooiphur bit kape eleiya ama apumtak manu sik-um apesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Levi 9:7</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Tu inkhat in thiampu kaliankhet inkhat eya khoya inthonasik atheinuo ah indangmak. Aaron ikoi angnga, mi inkhat kha Pathian in akoi libit thiampu kaliankhet in-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Suok 28:1</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Khawale in-ang rip-ah, Christa khan apumtak in thiampu kaliankhet inkhat achangna khoya kha inthomak. Khawa rathuulla, Pathian in amadiang ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Nang kasapa na-eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">awini kei napa ka-ejei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Ama innum munleiilak inkhat ah ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Nang thiampu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">Melchizedek mason dungjuiya kumsoot-ah thiampu na-echak sik eii.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Melchizedek angnga emakli Melchizedek rathuulla</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Minpkla 110:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Kathiya inphut ama kasanring mator, Pathian diang Jisu'n nuoipilchungnga aringlai, mitrathi sarra inringnga kheek-ah ama'n nina khat-um chana aleinei. Ama malung kadai khat-um Pathian kangamna ejarra, Pathian in ama nina kha aleijetpi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Takkha ama Pathian sapa e-innum, ama poongraalna khan chongkajui enasik ama'n alei-inchu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Ama puikatung inmin-epha, tu ka-ang ama chongkajui rakip sik-ah hektik kaneimak sanminringna akuung kha ama hong-ejei, <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>halli thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya Jisu kha thiampu kaliankhet ejei tia Pathian in amalarjei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Melchizedek angnga emakli Melchizedek rathuulla</char></note><verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngamna Inmathaanna chungnga chongpeii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Keini'n hiwa jarra rilsik tamtheichu om, takkha nangnidiang rilmincheensik chu intak, ajarchu nangni kajet hi ning-insuum.<verse eid="HEB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Nangni hiwapha hinchu ocha ngai ekacha ning-ejei, takkha nangni Pathian chongpui mansakhet inchusik kha-um kanaminchusik mi inkhat arei ninglaminom. Burum kabak sik rathuulla, tuunkatung nangni ranutui ka-insik ningla-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 Cor 3:2</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Tu ennum tuunkatung ranutui laka-in kha, akatha li akase iteii lakajetmak naiteii kha ala-eii. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Khattiang nitili, burum kabak hichu akatha li akase inni karra kakhoithen mator upa ngaisik eii.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Khawajarra mansakhet-ah inchusik Christian chongpui kha nuktiang da-inlang, puikatung minchuna tiang eini songrui. Eini'n Pathian diang ngamna kha nimathaan li anemna kaommak chuon ngaikha thona sik-ah lam boolmui; <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>baptize jarra minchuna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">baptize jarra; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">minthiangna chuonlam</char></note> halli kut duongpina jarra; kathi hongringna jarra khat-um hektik-kaommak chongtanna jar ngaihi eii. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Eini matiang khan songrui! Pathian izootkha e-inchu, hiwahi eii eini thosik kha.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Ajarchu ininngamna kamathaanjei tu ka-ang mi ngaikha angtho thoa woikhat malung minlet-ah heiruoikir mator sikme? Inmani apha khat-ah Pathian warra inomjei; inmani'n marwaan kutchoi kha inleimintemjei halli Ratha Inthiang tum kha-um inleiralaangjei. <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>Inmani'n Pathian chongkha inmintemma atha ti-um injet, halli akahongsik khangnga thomatorna ranak kha-um inmani'n injet. <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Hiwa suoa inmani'n ininngamna inmathaanjei! Inmani ngaikha woikhat malungthuulna tiang heiruoi kirthei emujei, ajarchu inmani'n Pathian Sapa kha mipui ma khan injak inpe ah inlet-ah inmani'n cross ah inthat eii.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Pathian in neipil hi rawaan apeii, achungnga ruo innolla iminsur kha neipil in aleimazoop, halli leikathopa nemnasik anse-suulpa aminmoongpi.<verse eid="HEB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Takkha raling le leihar amoong inchu, anemna ommakjei; Pathian in khomaak saamsik kha chi om halli meiya aminmang sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Inphut 3:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:18">18</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Takkha minriang kaom kasap ngai, keini'n hinna kati kinleiriljei innum, nangni jarrachu inthiangnga kinjet. Tichu nangni kheella katha rawaan nangnisik ka-eii sanminringna kha ningmujei ti keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Pathian chu malung inthiangmak emak. Ama'n ningchuontho emakli aleiilak Christian ngaisik tuun katung ningpena khat-um ama jarra minriangna ningmalarra ningsanna ngaikha manilnuni. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Nangni'n ningaidon ngaikha kadik tak-ah ajuotung nasik, ahekna katungnga nangni rakip in chuon karaat-ah ningtho kha keini imanuomkhet kha eii. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Keini'n nangni akadol esik hi manuommung, takkha kangamna li kadeiraat ngai ang inlang Pathian chong-inkhitna kamu eru.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Insial kaommak Pathian Chong-inkhitna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Pathian in Abraham diang chong-inkhit phakhan, achong-inkhitna kha thona sik-ah khomaak alei-insaam. Ama neek-ah kalok tuteii leiommu jarra, ama ramingtak kha inliingna ah khomaak lei-insaam.<verse eid="HEB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>Ama'n aleiti, “Kei'n nang nadiang chong-inkhitna kanei khachu kei'n nang rawaan napekata halli nang sali tu katamtak kanapesik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Inphut 22:16</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abraham chu kadeiraat kha lei-eii khawajarra Pathian chong-inkhitna kha ileimu eii. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Mi ngai'n khomaak ininsaampha, inmani'n tu ka-ang inmani neek-ah kalokdet inkhat raming kha inneiman, halli khawa khomaak insaamna khan chong inseiina rakip kha aminhek. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Ama chong inkhitna kamusik inmani diang, Pathian in ingaidonjei kha angtikniteii thuulnunijei tia iminthiar hi amanuom; khawajarra ama khomaak insaamna kha chong-inkhitna khan athundeljei. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Inthuul theimak sik phur inni aom, khawa khan Pathian maleisei riltheinuni. Khawajarra eini amale inruoiya ringna kamujei eini maikuungnga inngamna inadapi kha kacheet-ah mahuum nasik katha tak-ah namasok eii.<verse eid="HEB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Eini'n niringphuuk hang chalnasik hiwa inngamna hi ninei. Hiwahi kacheet khat-um insialmak kha ejei, halli marwaan biak-inna induong maiduongpuon thengnga inthiangkhet mun katung aluut. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Levi 16:2</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Jisu'n eini rathuulla khawa inthiangkhet mun kha eini matiang aleiluutjei, halli thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya thiampu kaliankhet kha kumsoot sik-ah ahong ejei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(enru 5:6).</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Minpkla 110:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Thiampu Melchizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Hiwa Melchizedek hi Salem reng lei-eii halli Insaangkhet Pathian Thiampu inkhat lei-eii. Abraham in reng mili ngai ajothatna raalmunna inphut aheikirpha, Melchizedek in ama lei-inmupui halli ama kha rawaan aleipeii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Inphut 14:17-20</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>halli Abraham in ama iheichoi rakip kha soomma inkhat kha amadiang aleipei. (Mansakhet Melchizedek raming jetna hi “Akadik Reng”; halli ama hi Salem reng ejarra, ama raming um “Akadai Reng.”) tia injetna. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melchizedek anu emakli apa jarra injia ommak emakli ama pilepu jarra injia ommak, halli ama inneina emakli athina injia um ommak. Amachu Pathian Sapa ka-ang eii; kumsoot-ah thiampu eya aom.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Khawajarra ama angtuk kalokme tikha nangni'n enru. Araming kasi nipu Abraham in raalmunna inphut iheichoi rakip soomma inkhat kha amadiang aleipeii.<verse eid="HEB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Levi tuli-sa thiampu ka-e ngaikhan inmitak ka-eii Israel mi ngai diangnga inphut soomma inkhat rathai nasik Dan in chong leipeii dungjuiya, Abraham tuli-sa in-e-innum inpesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Teelna 18:21</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melchizedek kha Levi tuli-sa makheiya emak, takkha ama'n Abraham Pathian chong-inkhitna karalaangpa diangnga inphut soomma inkhat kha aleiya amadiang rawaan aleipeii. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Rawaan kamupa neek-ah rawaan kapepa khan alokwiai tihi inngamsam nasik ommak. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Thiampu ngai dungjuiyachu soomma inkhat inrathai kha alakathisik mi ngai'n inrathai eii; takkha Melchizedek dungjuiyachu soomma inkhat irathai kha kathimak sikpa in irathai eii. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Halli, Abraham in soomma inkhat ipekhan, (ama tuli-sa kachang ngai'n soomma inkhat inrathai kha) Levi innum khawakha apejei tia aril. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Abraham in Melchizedek inmupuilai khan Levi laneimu, takkha inpu kachang Abraham thiya leiomjei.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Levi phungnga thiampu changna chungnga Israel mi ngaidiang Dan kha aleipeii. Tuun, Levi phungnga thiampu ngai chuonkha pui leitungjei inchu, Aaron dungjuiya ka-emak thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(enru 5:6)</char></note> thiampu leiilak inkhat arei leiom nunijei. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Ajarchu thiampu inroondan kha inthuulpha, dan kha-um inthuulsik asuokjei. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Takkha eini Pumi hiwa omchan inrilpa hi, intei phungkhat ta kha eii, halli ama phungnga miring inkhat innum maichaam khan thiampu eya sepa leithomu. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Ama hi Judah phungnga injuonei miring inkhat eii tia eini pumi in irilkha katha-ah nijet; halli Moses in thiampu ngai jarra ama'n aleiril laikhan hiwa phung hi leiminchelmak.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Melchizedek ka-ang, Thiampu inkhat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Melchizedek ka-ang, thiampu intei inkhat inlarjei; hiwa akasuok omchan hin kheella inthiarjei. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Ama hi miring ngai sinadan khat-um thodan ngai dungjuiya thiampu inkhat inminchang emak, takkha hektik kaboi ringna ranak khanna eii.<verse eid="HEB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Ajarchu chong-inthiang in ati, “Nang thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya kumsoot-ah thiampu na-echaksik eii”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thiampu Melchizedek mason dungjuiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(enru 5:6) </char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Minpkla 110:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Khawajarra sinadan maruo kha, neiman kathamak khat-um kasuol ahong ejarra, inkhai kha ejei. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Ajarchu Moses dan khan iteii pui mintung matormak. Takkha tuunchu akathadet ngamna kha anapejei, khawa khan eini'n Pathian diang niheinaikha ejei.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Khawakhan Pathian khomaak insaamna kha-um inchelsa ejei. Mi leiilak ngai thiampu inmin-elai khan khawa ka-ang khomaak insaamna kha leiommak. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Pathian in amadiang hin ati laikhan, Jisu chu khomaak insaamli thiampu hong eii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Pumi khan chong-inkhitna inkhat anei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">Halli khawa kha leikir nunijei</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Nang kumsoot-ah thiampu kha na-echaksik ejei.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Minpkla 110:4</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Khawajarra, hiwa inteina hin, Jisu hi kathakhet inzootna kanapepa kha amin-ejei.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Hiwahin inteina inkhat aom: thiampu katamtak khat ngai khachu inthi jarra inchuon kha minson matormujei. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Takkha Jisu khachu kumsoot-ah karingchak, halli thiampu ena achuon kha tu ka-ang inkhat diang um leipemak. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Halli ama'n tuun khat-um kumsoot ah um ama diangnga inphut Pathian diang akahong ngai asanring mator, ajarchu ama kumsoot-ah akaringchak ejarra, inmani sik-ah Pathian diang anichak ah om.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Khawajarra einisik arei ka-e anakape sik-ah Jisu kha Thiampu Kaliankhet kha ejei. Amachu inthiang kha eii. Ama'n manu emakli masialna iteii neimak; ama'n manukaroon ngai diangnga inphut inteiya omjei, halli marwaan rakip chungtiang omjei.<verse eid="HEB 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Amachu thiampu kaliankhet leiilak ngai ka-ang emak; mansa-ah ama manusik khat-um khawasuoa mipui manu sik-ah nisuo rakip apum inphalsik arei ommakjei. Ama atheinuoa inpesuok phakhan, woikhat na-inphalpi khan kumsoot sik-ah ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Levi 9:7</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Moses Dan in puikatungmak mi ngaikha thiampu kaliankhet ka-esik aleikadang; takkha dan nuk-ah kajuo Pathian khomaksaam le inruoiya chong-inkhitna kha in Sapa kha akadangnga kumsoot sik-ah puikatung amin-ejei.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Eini Thiampu Kaliankhet Jisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Hiwarakip eini'n nirilna chongru khetkha angme nitinchu, marwaanna Pathian reng in-ongna changtiangnga in-ong kha ka-ang Thiampu Kaliankhet eini'n ninei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Miring kut-ah insak ka-emak Pumi khan isak inthiang maichaam innsuungnga Inthiang Khet Munkhan thiampu kaliankhet eya Ama'n sepa itho kha eii.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Thiampu kaliankhet rakip in Pathian diangnga kutchoi ngai khat-um inthooina sangai kape sik-ah inkadang eii, khawajarra eini Thiampu Kaliankhet innum angmekhat pesik anei ngersik asuok. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Ama'n nuoipil chungnga leiom inchu, thiampu lei-enuni, ajarchu Jihudi ngai Dan dungjuiya kutchoi kapesik thiampu ngaikha inleiom suojei.<verse eid="HEB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Thiampu ngai'n inmani chuon inleitho kha inthiangnga marwaanna omchan khat-um raliim bitkha intho eii. Moses in itho khale in-angrip kha eii. Ama'n Inthiang Maichaam-inn asaksik phakhan, Pathian in Moses diangkhan ati, “Chingnga nangdiang naminmu omchan rakip ngaikha masialleiya sakro.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Suok 25:40</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Takkha tuunchu, Jisu diang khan inmani ta neek-ah akalok thiampu chuon kha inpejei, ajarchu hiwahi akathakhet chong-inkhitna inkhat ejarra, Pathian li ama mi ngai karra inadapi inzootna kha-um akatha alei eii.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Inzootna mansakhet khan insialna leiommak inchu, inni huuina hi arei enunijei. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Takkha Pathian in ami ngai masialna kha amu phakhan hintia aril,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Nikhuo ngaikha ahongjei, Pumi in ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">kei'n Israel mi ngai khat-um Judah mi ngaile inruoiya inzootna kathar inkhat kaboolsik ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Hiwahi kei'n inpi-inpu ngaile inzootna kileibool khale in-ang nunijei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">khawani khan Egypt ramma inphut inmani inkut kamahuumma kiheikeisuok eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Kei'n inmani le kibool inzootna kha leijuimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">halli kei innum inmani kha ngaidon mongjei, pumi in ati.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Tuun, hiwa inzootna hi eii kei'n Israel mi ngaile inruoiya kaboolsik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">akahongsik nikhuo ngaikhan, Pumi'n ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kei'n inmalung ngaikhan kei dan ngaikha kadapisik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">halli inngaidonna ngaikhan kamajia pisik eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Kei inmani Pathian ka-esik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">halli inmani khan kami in-esik eii.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Inmani tu inkhat innum insap ngaidiang minchu nunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">emakli inmani indiang inwaipui ngaidiang-um rilnunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Pumi kha jetru’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Ajarchu kasiin khet-ah inphut kalokkhet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">inmani rakip in kei innalajetsik eii.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Inmanu ngaikha kei'n kangaidam sik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">halli inmani masialna ngaikha kei'n ngaidon khainuning jei.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Inzootna kathar khat nirilna hin, Pathian in ma-insa kha amaruo min-ejei; halli amaruo khat-um kheella hongkamaruo rakip kha innot-ah amangsik ejei.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Nuoipil khat-um Marwaanna Chubeithona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Inzootna ma-insa khan chubei thonasik sinadan khat-um chubei thonasik inbool amun inkhat aleiom.<verse eid="HEB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Maichaam-inn inkhat inleisak, tuol kadep khetkha, Inthiang Mun inti. Khawa munkhan meiserkeii khat-um khamtuol insaang chungnga waipool kha Pathian diang inpena eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Suok 26:1-30</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">25:23-30</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Inni changna maiduongpuon nukkhan maichaam-inn inkhat om khawa kha Inthiangkhet Mun inti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Suok 26:31-33</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Khawa munkhan arimkahoi rouna soonna maichaam om, Inzootna soonna reelkha aom khat-um khawa reel suungkhan manna inthun soonna rabing kha om, Alor kaom Aaron kherol, khat-um chongpeii ngaikha injia lungpeek inni aom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Suok 30:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:33">16:33</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Teelna 17:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:16">Suok 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Innidan 10:3-5</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Reel chungkhan Pathian om ti malarna, murtha indou Cherubim ngai'n manu ngaidamna mun chungkhan inlurna inmurtha inmajarra inom. Takkha angrakip hi rilcheen nasik apha tuun la-emak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Suok 25:18-22</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Hiwa rakip hi hinthoa inbool suoli, thiampu ngaikhan inchuon katho sik-ah nisuo rakip-ah maichaam inntuol kadep khan inluut, <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Teelna 18:2-6</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>takkha suung-innungkhet maichaam innkhan, kumkhat suungnga woikhat bit thiampu kaliankhet bitkhan aluut-ah atheinuo sik le mi rakipsik, jetleiya manu inleithona ngaikha mi rakip rathuulla thisen kha achoiya Pathian diang ajuopeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Levi 16:2-34</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Maichaam inntuol kadep kha alangir laisengchu Inthiang khet Mun kha la-inlongmak, hiwa rakip chuonminsuuk ah inphut hin Ratha Inthiang khan inthiangnga naminchu eii. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Hiwahi tuunlai pha sik-ah minkhina inkhat eii. Hi tinachu kutchoi ngai khat-um dooiphur sa Pathian diang inpekhan chubei kathopa malung kha pui mintung matormak, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>hiwa bakle in ngaihi sinadan dungjuiya inthiangnasik bit-ah intho chuon ngaikha eii. Hiwa ngaiseng hi Pathian in akathar inzootna mason abool maklaiseng sik-ah tuol tiangnga thosik ah sinadan ngai bitkha alei-eii.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Takkha hinna kaom akatha ngai chungnga Thiampu Kaliankhet inkhat eya Christa kha ijuo ejei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ijuo ejei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat in </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hin omjei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">inti</char></note> Ama'n maichaam innsuungnga sepa ithopa khan khella alok khat-um kheella pui atung; hiwahi miring kut-ah inbool nuoipilchung maichaam-inn kha emak, khat-um hiwa nuoipilchung inboollaiya inchel um emak. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Christa in maichaam innsuungnga asili apha rakip sik-ah woikhatbit Inthiang khet Mun khan aluut phakhan, ama'n keel li saraatchal thisen dooiphurra pesik leichoimak, khawa rathuulla, ama'n apumtak thisen kha achoiya halli eini sik-ah hektik kaboi sanminringna kha anaminmujei.<verse eid="HEB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Keel thisen le saraatchal thisen khat-um saraatteii inrouna rahut khan insidan dungjuiya inthiangmak mi ngai chungnga inkathingsik eii. halli inmani sinadan dungjuiya inthiangmak kha inkhaipiya hiwahin inmani inminthiang eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 16:15">Levi 16:15</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Teelna 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Hiwahi akadik ejarra, Christa thisen khan angtuk kheeldoomma akatha min-eme! Hektik kaboi Ratha khan ama atheinuo ah puikatung dooiphur eya Pathian diang ipekha ejei. Eini'n akaringchak Pathian sepa nithotheina sik anemna kaommak sinadan ngai khanna inphut, eini kase katha jetna malung hi ama thisen khan anaminthiang pisik eii.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Hiwasik bit-ah akathar inzootna kanaboolpipa kha Christa kha ejei, ama'n ma-insa inzootna nuoiya kaom chongpeii kamakoi ngaikha masuona sik-ah ama'n anathipijei, hiwahi chong lei-inkhitna hektik kaboi munasik kasuok kha ikoi inmani'n inmunasik ejei.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Lungdou injia inkhat kha inthiangnga malarsik hi arei ejarra khawa lungdou kaboolpa kha akathi ejei, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>ajarchu lungdou kaboolpa kha aringlaiseng khawa lungdou kha iteii nemnamak; ama athisuoli bit ranak inei eii. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Khawajarra inzootna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">inzootna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek ah hiwa chongtak hi “lungdou” khat-um “inzootna” tina eii</char></note> ma-insa kha-um thisen inneimanlibit ranak kaom eii.<verse eid="HEB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Mansakhet-ah, Moses in mi ngaidiang Dan suungnga kaom chongpeii rakip ngaikha aleirilpi. Khawa suoli tuile inminchun keel ngaili saraatchal ngai thisen ama'n aleiya samul kasenli khuoichubor neimanna Dan larik khat-um mi rakip kha leikathingthuon. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Ama'n aleiti, “Hiwahi Pathian in nangnidiang juisik ah inapeii inzootna thisen kha eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Suok 24:6-8</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Hiwale in-angrip ah Moses innun Inthiang Maichaam-inn khat-um chubei thona ah inneiman phur rakip chungnga thisen kha aleikathing thuon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Levi 8:15</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Inthiangnga, Dan dungjuiya phur rakip kha thisen khan aminthiang, halli thisen sarleiya chu manu ngai ngaidamna kha ommak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Levi 17:11</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Inphalna khan Manu rakip aroon suojei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Khawale in-ang rip-ah marwaanta tak khale in-ang phur ngaihi hinthoa minthiangsik hi arei eii. Takkha marwaan phur ngai tak kha hineek ah akatha dooiphur kha arei eii. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Ajarchu inthiangtak in-ang miring kut-ah inbool Inthiang Mun khan Christa kha iluut emak. Ama'n marwaan tak khan asiya tuunchu eini rathuulla Pathian maikuungnga inlarjei. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Jihudi ngai thiampu kaliankhet in Inthiang khet Mun khan kumkhat ah woikhat sathi le inruoiya iluut eii. Takkha Christa chu innol innolla apumtak inpesik ah kaluut emak, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>ajarchu ama'n nuoipilchung inbool makheiya inphut innol innolla aleipoongsik eii. Khawa rathuulla, tuunchu khang rakip aheknasik ajuonai phakhan manu khainasik-ah apumtak najuo inphalpi dungjuiya ama'n apha rakip sik-ah woikhatbit na-inlarpijei. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Mirakip woikhat nilathisik eii, khawa suoli Pathian in chong tansik eii.<verse eid="HEB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Khawale in-ang rip-ah, Christa kha-um mi katamtak manu ngai kakhai sik-ah woikhat bit-ah na-inphalpi ejei. ama woini huuina alajuo inlarsik eii, khachu Manu chungnga chuonkathosik emakjei, takkha ama kangaakchak ah kaom ngai kasanring sik-ah ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Jihudi ngai Dan kha chu akatha phur lakajuosik raliim kha eii halli ka-etak phur ngaikha emak. Khawa jarra kumsuo ah inmani'n inchatlekleiya inpeii dooiphur ngaikhan heikaluut mi ngaikha angtikniteii pui mintungmak. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Pathian chubeikatho mi ngaikha inmanuwa inphut inthiangtak in e-inchu, manu jarra kahoimak woikhat inlet-ah inmani diang suok khainuni jei, halli dooiphur rakip ngaikha inleidasik ejei. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Takkha kum rakip-ah dooiphur inpekhan mi ngaikha inmanu ngaikha inminngaidon. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Ajarchu saraatchal li keel ngai thisen khan manu ngaikha angtikniteii khaimatormak.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Hiwa jarra, Christa khan manmasituolla ajuo siktiang, ama'n Pathian diang ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Nang in kutchoi ngai li dooiphur ngaikha manuom makche,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">takkha nang in keisik taksa inkhat nanaminsuukpi.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Nang in maichaam chungnga sangai inroumang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">emakli manu ngai kamimmangsik doiphur ngaikhan namalung taimak.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>kei'n kaleiti, ‘Kei hin kaom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">nang nalungdou katho sik-ah, E Pathian,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Dan larik ah kei kajarra injia angnga.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Minpkla 40:6-8</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Ama'n ma-insa ah aleiti, “Nang in kutchoi khat-um dooiphur ngai emakli manu ngai minmangna sik-ah sangai maichaam chungnga inroumang hi manuommakche khat-um namalung taimak.” Ama'n hiwahi aleiti Dan dungjuiya hiwa dooiphur rakip inpe innum. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Hiwasuoli ama'n aleiti, “E Pathian, nalungdou katho sik-ah kei hin kaom.” Khawajarra Pathian in dooiphur maruo ngaikha aminmangjei halli Christa inphalpina kha aminthuulpijei. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Pathian minthozoot kha Jisu Christa in athojei jarra, eini rakip sik-ah ama'n apumtak kha apha rakipsik woikhat bit inpesuokna khan manu makheiya anaminthiangjei.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Jihudi ngai thiampu rakip in ama chuon ngaikha nisuo-ah intho halli dooiphur in-angrip kha innolla inpeii; takkha hiwa dooiphur pena ngaikhan manu ngaikha angtikniteii leiminmang matormak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 29:38">Suok 29:38</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Christa in, manu ngai sik-ah woikhat inphalna khan kumsoot sik-ah na-inphalpi ejei, halli ama'n Pathian changtiang khan in-ongjei. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Ama inhalpui ngaikha Pathian in ama ketouna ah adamak laiseng tuun ama khawakhan ngaak ah aom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Minpkla 110:1</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Woikhatbit inphalna khan, manuwa inphut iminthiang ngaikha kumsoot sik-ah puikatung ejei.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Halli Ratha Inthiang innum einidiang ama sakhi napejei. Mansakhet-ah ama'n ati,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>“Hiwahi inmanile inruoiya kei'n kaboolsik inzootna kha eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">akahongsik nikhuo ngaikhan, Pumi in ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Kei'n inmalung ngaikhan kei dan ngaikha kadapisik eii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">halli inngaidonna ngaikhan kamajia pisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31:33</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Halli ama'n ati, “Kei'n inmani manu ngai khat-um inchuontho kathamak ngaikha ngaidon khainuningjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31:34</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Khawajarra hiwa manu ngai inngaidampha, manu ngai kaminmangsik dooiphur inkhat kha arei ommakjei.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian diang Eini nairui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Khawajarra, ulenai ngai, Jisu thisen khan Inthiang khet Munna kasi sik-ah inngamna kha nineijei. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Maiduongpuon tinachu ama apumtak khan ringna lam, kathar lam einisik ama'n namalongpijei. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Eini thiampu kaliankhet Pathian innsuung karoon inkhat kha ninei.<verse eid="HEB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Khawajarra kase katha jetna malung inthiangmak ah inphut malung inthiangle taksa ngaihi tui inthiang khan rasuthiang inlang kangamnatak le malung inthiang khan Pathian diang eini'n nairui. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Levi 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezek 36:25</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Eini'n nirilsuok ni-inngamna kha kacheet-ah mahuumrui, ajarchu ama chong-inkhitna kha nida theinasik eini'n Pathian kha ni-ngamna. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Eini inkhat li inkhat inngaidon inlang inkhat li inkhat inriang malar nasik insanrui halli akatha kha thorui. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Mi lekkhat in intho angnga, ni-intuup jolhi eini damui, Pumi juonasik Nikhuo ajuonaijei ti ningjet angnga, kheella khat li khat eini malung insokrui.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Ajarchu einidiang akatuun kha naminjet suonuk, nijet pumma eini'n manu nilatho inchu, manu minmang nasik-ah na-inphalpi woikhat omnunijei.<verse eid="HEB 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Khawa rathuulla, kachi le inruoiya ngaaksik lakaom rakip khachu meikakaang in Pathian inhalpui ngai minmang nasik khat-um alakajuosik chongtanna khabit ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa 26:11</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Tu e-innum Moses Dan kajuimak ama kha chong-intan pha, inni emakli inthum sakhiya inphut amasialna inmu inchu, minriang omleiya inthatsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Innidan 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Khawakha e-inchu, Pathian Sapa innuipui ngai, Inmani manuwa inphut kaminthiang inzootna Pathian thisen kha aman kaommak angnga kalei ngai, riangwai Ratha kha innuipui ngai, Inmani sik-ah rahoikasuok rachaakna kha angtuk kathamak sikme? ngaidonru! <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Suok 24:8</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Ajarchu ama'n iti kha eini'n nijet, “Kei'n phaphu kaluoksik eii, kei'n kapekirsik eii”; halli ama innum inlet-ah ati, “Pumi'n ami ngaikha chong tansik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Innidan 32:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:36">Innidan 32:36</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Akaring Pathian kut chungnga kachulsik hi chikaomtak inkhat kha eii!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Matiang khan angtho-thoa hiwahi nangnidiang aleisuokme ngaidonru. Khawa nikhuo ngaikhan, Pathian war kha ningchungnga aminwar suonuk, nangni'n angjet ningleipoong, kha e-innum khawa poongna khan naleimatormak. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Aphakhat khan nangni mipui karra inna-innuipui khat-um kase-ah innaleitho, halli aleiilak pha khat-ah hiwale in-angrip ah leiilak mi ngai'n poongraalna inneipha kadeipui sik-ah ning inchelpui ejei. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Nangni'n kheella akatha kumsoot kasisik angmekhat ningnei kha ningjet jarra, ningnei rakip kha innakasut innum karok-ah ningdeimator, halli mikhumna-ah kaom ngai poongna khannum ningdeipui. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Nangni ngamna kha minmang maru, ajarchu khawakhan thoman kalokkhet kha aheichoisik eii. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Pathian lungdou kha thona sik-ah khat-um angme ama chong-inkhitna kha ralaangnasik ah nangni kadeikaraat sik hi arei ejei. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Ajarchu, chong-inthiang iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Phabong khat suoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">akajuosik ama kha ajuosik jei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">ama jo-insuum nuni.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Kha e-innum kami kadik ngaikhan, inngamna inta halli inringsik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">takkha inmani karra tu ka-ang inkhat in nuktiang inheikir inchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Kei inmani chungnga kamalung tainuni.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="HEB 2:3">Heb 2:3</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 2:4">4</ref> </char><verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Eini chu nuktiang kirra inmang mi ngaikha emakmi. Khawa rathuulla, eini ngamna kanei khat-um karing ngaikha ni-ejei.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Eini'n ningaidon ka-etak sik nimu matormak phurkha ngamna kha eii. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Tiallaiya mi ngai'n inmani inngamna khan Pathian zootpina kha inleimu.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Ngamna khan manmasituol hi Pathian chong khanna inbool eii tihi eini'n nijet, khawajarra angme nimu hi nimumak khanna inbool eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 1:1">Inphut 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Minpkla 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jn 1:3</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Ngamna khan eii Abel in Cain neek-ah Pathian diang akathakhet kutchoi kha aleipeii. Ama inngamna jarra Pathian amatak in akutchoi ngaikha ralaangpiya mi kadik inkhat amin-ejei, ama athijei innum, Ama inngamna jarra Abel tuun katung inlaril. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Inphut 4:3-10</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Ngamna jarra Enoch thina kha leimumak. Khawa rathuulla, Pathian koolla ama kha aleiruoijei, halli tuteii innum mununujei. Ajarchu Pathian in ama kha aleiruoijei, Chong-inthiang in ati Enoch chungtiang aruoi makma, ama'n Pathian malung aleimintai. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Inphut 5:21-24</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Ngamna inchelleiya tu-innum Pathian malung mintai matormu, ajarchu Pathian diangnga akahong rakip in Pathian ringnga-om halli ama karatok ngaidiang Pathian in inchuonthoman kha apesik eii tihi inngam nasik eii.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Noah inngamna khan ama'n inlamumak nuktiangnga hongkasuok sik ngai jarra Pathian chongpe ngaikha aleirangai. Ama'n Pathian chong kha ajuiya rakuong inkhat kha aleibool halli khawa suungkhan ama le a-innsuung mi ngaikha inringnga inleiom. Khanthoa, nuoipilchung hi minmangjei, ngamna jarra Pathian diangnga kajuo akadik kha Noah in aleimujei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Inphut 6:13-22</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Pathian in Abraham kha akoipha, ama'n angamna jarra achong kha ajui, Pathian in amadiang ape sik-ah chong-inkhitna ramtiang aleisi. Ama'n hunme isi jetleiya ama'n aram kha aleimathaanjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Inphut 12:1-5</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Ngamna jarra khawa ramkhan khuolmi inkhat eya Pathian in amadiang chong-inkhitna ramkhan ama'n ajuo-om. Pathian diangnga in-angrip chong-inkhitna kamu Isaac li Jacob itho angnga, ama'n maichaam-inn ngaikhan aleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Inphut 35:27</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Ajarchu Pathian ibool khat-um isak kumsoot kangirsik khopui kha Abraham in ngaak-ah aleiom.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Abraham li Sarah intarjei innum, Inmani'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inmani'n; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscripts lekkhat in Sarah khan ajuotarra sakanei sik emak jei innum ngamna khan nai kha ahongwon. Ama </char></note> Pathian chong-inkhitna hi atung ngersik eii tihi inngamna jarra, ngamna khan Abraham hi pa inkhat ahong emator. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Inphut 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Abraham thijei innum, hiwa mi inkhat ah inphut tuli-sa katam hongsuok ah lairalak ah kaom arsi ngai, khat-um tuipui khamma kaom teelmatorlei neeldi inhong angjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Inphut 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Hiwa mi ngai senghi ngamna khan inleithijei. Inmani'n Pathian chong-inkhitna kha leimumu, takkha akalaaktak-ah inphut inmani'n inleimuwa inleidon eii, halli nuoipilchung hin khuolmi khat-um innlelei kaboi kin-eii tia inlarra inleirilsuok. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 23:4">Inphut 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Khang 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Minpkla 39:12</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Khawa leikaril mi ngaikhan inmani'n inta ka-esik ram inkhat kha in-entok eii ti inthiangnga inlar eii. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Inmani'n inheida ramtiang khan kirsik hi leingaidonmu; inmani'n inleingaidon inchu, heikirnasik aphakacha kha-um inleinei. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Khawa rathuulla, inmani'n kheella katha ram, marwaan ram kha inrangaitui eii. Pathian in inmani sik khuopui inkhat aboolpijei, khawajarra inmani Pathian ka-eii tia inkoi sik hi Pathian in injakmak.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Pathian in Abraham malung enpha khan, ngamna jarra Abraham in asapa Isaac kha dooiphur inkhat-ah aleipeii. Pathian in chong inkhitpui kha Abraham kha lei-eii, khawa e-innum asapa inkhat bit innei kha ama'n dooiphur inkhat-ah penasik alei-insuuk. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Inphut 22:1-14</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>Pathian in amadiang aleitipi, kei chong inkhitna khachu, “Isaac ah inphut nang in tuli-sa ngai naneisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Inphut 21:12</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Pathian in Isaac kha kathiya inphut aminring mator tihi Abraham in aleijet, halli ileiril angnga, Abraham in Isaac kha kathiya inphut imu eii.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Ngamna khan Isaac in Jacob li Esau diang nuktiangnga juokatungsik chong-inkhitna rawaan kha aleipeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Inphut 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Ngamna khan Jacob in athimadet Joseph sangai rakip diang rawaan kha aleipejei. Halli ama'n asina kherol chungkhan inngaiya Pathian chubei aleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Inphut 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Ngamna khan Joseph in athi siktiang, Israel sangai Egypt ah inphut inheisuoksik jarra aleiril, halli ang-omchanna akaluong kha inreii sikme tia minchuna aleinei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 50:24">Inphut 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Suok 13:19</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Ngamna khan Moses nuli pa ngai'n innei suonuk thathum inleithup. Inmani'n naiteii meelkatha kha inmuwa Rengpa chongpeii makoisik kha leichimujei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Suok 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Suok 1:22</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Ngamna khan, Moses in ahonglokpha Pharaoh sanu sapa tia inkoisik leizootmakjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Suok 2:10-12</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Phabongkhat manuwa hoisik neek-ah Pathian mi ngaile poong suomsik hi ama'n aleimanuom. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Ama'n nuktiangnga chuonthoman amu sik kha a-enna, Egypt karei rakip neisik neek-ah Messiah sik-ah innuipuina deisik hi kheella anemna om tihi aleingaidon.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Ngamna khan Moses in rengpa raangna kha chileiya Egypt kha amathaanjei. Ajarchu nimumak Pathian kha imu angnga, nuktiang kirsik kha leizootmak jei.<verse eid="HEB 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Ngamna khan ama'n Rakaanna kahoi aphutpui, Mikathat Marwaan tirton khan Israel ngai salutir pasal ngai sengchu athatmak nasik, innkhar ngaikhan thisen kathingru tia chong leipeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Suok 12:21-30</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Ngamna khan Israel sa ngai'n Tuipui Kasen (Red Sea) kha neipil kahuul chungnga insi angnga inleirakaan; Egypt sa ngai'n heirakaansik inthopha, inmani kha tui'n leitumjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Suok 14:21-31</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Ngamna khan Jericho bang ngaikha Israel sa ngai'n nisari inkahiiltong suoli, achiamjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Josh 6:12-21</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Ngamna khan zool-inthainu Rahab khan Israel ruongngai ngaikha ama'n sap khat-ah aleidon jarra, Pathian chongkajuimak ngai inthatna ah inphut ringna aleinei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">Josh 6:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Josh 2:1-21</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Kei'n angme karildelsik? Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jephthah, David, Samuel, khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai jarra rilnasik keisik apha ommak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">Chongtan 4:6–5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">6:11–8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11:1–12:7</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13:2–16:31</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1 Sam 1:1–25:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Reng 2:11</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Ngamna jarra inmani'n ram pumpui raal inthoa inleimator. Inmani'n akatuun kha intho jarra Pathian chong-inkhitna ngaikha inleimu. Inmani'n sabakkai ngai murkha inleikhar, <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6:1-27</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>mei kangar kha inleimindai, chemma inphut thatnasik khan inleisuok. Inmani inleisuol, takkha akaraat inhong-ejei; inmani raalla akaraat in-eja ram-leiilak raalmi ngaikha inleimatorjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3:1-30</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Ngamna jarra numeisa ngai'n inmani innaipui kathi ngaikha karingnga inmujei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Aleiilak ngaikhan masuo kha inzootmak jarra, kheella poongna indeiya inthijei, hiwahi ringkhuo akatha-ah inring theinasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1 Reng 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2 Reng 4:25-37</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Lekkhat kha ininnuipuiya inleiwuok, halli lekkhat in inkhit-ah mikhumna khan inleida. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1 Reng 22:26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 22:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2 Khang 18:25</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Inmani ngaikha inleideengthat, inmani kha thing-aatna khan bongni inleiminchang, halli chemma inmani kha inleitukthat. Inmani keelngam emakli keelwun ngai insilla inleisi-inleihong, sara inlei-eii inleirachaak khat-um kase-ah inleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Khang 24:21</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Inmani sik-ah nuoipilchung hi akatha lei-emak jei. Inmani innlelei kaboi angnga, neelramma, chingnga, khurpui khat-um khur ngaikhan insi-inhongnga inleiom.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Inmani ngamna jarra hiwa injia rakip hi inmatorjei! Kha e-innum Pathian chong-inkhitna ngai khachu inmani'n leimumu, <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>ajarchu Pathian in eini sik-ah akathakhet inkhat nangaidonpijei. Ama ingaidon khachu einile inruoiya inmani kha pui mintungsik hi eii.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Eini Pa Pathian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Khawajarra eini um, hiwatuk kalok suumphai ka-ang sakhi ngaikhan nakahiilla omjarra, karik rakip, khat-um beitheiya nakasur manu kha eini'n masuorui, halli eini matiangnga inda ruolsiak taanna kha kadeikaraat le inruoiya taanrui. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Eini ngamna Inphutna khat-um insuona ka-e Jisu diangkhan eini'n en chakrui, ama'n cross chungnga injaktheiya athisik kha iteiiya ngaidonmak! Khawa rathuulla, rokna khan ama i-ngaakchak kha angaidonna, Cross ah nathipiya, tuunchu Pathian reng in-ongna changtiang ama in-ongnga omjei.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Manukaroon ngai'n ama kha khatuktak inleimatir katung ama'n ileidei kha ngaidonru! Khawajarra nangni ningtheinuo-ah ningmalung minpoongmaru khat-um malung kahoimak thomaru. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Ajarchu nangni'n manu chungnga raal ningdei kha nangni'n thina katungchu ladeimakchu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Malung masokna chong ngai nangnidiang Pathian ama'n asa ngai angnga naminchu kha ningmanil bejei?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Kasapa, Pumi khan anamintuun pha katha-ah rangairo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">halli naran pha malung hoimak thomaro. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Job 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Chongil 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Ajarchu Pumi'n iminriang mi ngaikha amintuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">halli ama'n izoot sapa rakip kha arachaak.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Pa inkhat eya narachaakna poongna kha nangni'n deiru; ajarchu nangni poongna khan Pathian in asa ngai kapuo ah nangni narachaakna kha inlar eii. Apa in irachaakmak asa omngaiyabe? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Nangni rakip kha ama sangai angnga narachaakmak inchu, nangni asa tak emakchu, takkha buojai sangai kha ning eii. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Eini miring taksa pa ngai'n, eini innarachaak halli eini'n inmani kha khoya nitho. Kha e-inchu, angtuk kheella eini ratha Pa diangkhan niluut-ah halli niringsik kasuokme! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Eini miring taksa pa ngai khan pha bongkhat sik inmani'n hiwahi adik tia eini innarachaak eii, takkha eini'n ama inthiangna kha nichang theinasik hiwahi eini thana sik-ah Pathian i-narachaak eii. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Eini narachaak pha, rachaakna khan phabongkhat nimalung minnuor khat-um rokmakmi. Kha e-innum hiwa rachaakna in i-mintuun ngaikha nuk achu, ringkhuo kadik malung daina karakha inluok.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minchuna le Chongmakhaina ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Ningkut kajeng ngaikha thaangru, halli ningkemurkhup intuul ngaikha minngarru! <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa 35:3</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Lam katuun ngaikhan siru, kha e-inchu kasitheimak keii kha omnunijei, takkha khawa rathuulla adamsik ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Chongil 4:26</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Mirakip le kadaiya omnasik khat-um ringkhuo inthiang inkhat ah ringnasik thoru, ajarchu khawa incheelleiya tu inkhat innum Pumi kha mumatornuni.<verse eid="HEB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Pathian riangwaiya inphut nuktiang kirmak nasik insingtheiru. tu inkhat innum kakha thingkuung inkhat angnga hongmoongli atur kha insuina angjet kamasuok hong-emaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Innidan 29:18</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Esau in salutir achangna atum kha chara inkhat sik-ah ijuor angnga, omchan-kathamak emakli kadikmak ithokha tu inkhat innum hongtho maru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Inphut 25:29-34</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Khawasuo, tichu, apa rawaan kha ama'n amanuomma mitrathi sarpumma ama'n ajo-entok takkha zootmak ah ileithosuo kha thuulnasik lam kha mumak jarra akirjei ti nangni'n ningjet.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:17. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ama'n ajo-entok; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama'n rawaan munasik aleitho</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Inphut 27:30-40</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Israel mi ngai'n Sinai Chingnga inhong angnga nangni chu kahong emakchu, katook katha, meimachuon, kaziing khat-um kaziingkhap, ruosur thikaraang, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Suok 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Innidan 4:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>tampaloi rasa khat-um chong rasa. Mi ngai'n rasa kha injetpha khan, inmani'n woikhat chongkha injetmaknasik inleini,<verse eid="HEB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>ajarchu inmani'n chongpeii iril kha leidei matormu, “Sa e-innum ching kha ajokatook inchu, lungnga deengthatsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Suok 19:12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Aleikasuok inmu kha khatuk chi leiom Moses in aleiti, “Kei kaleichi halli kalei-intuul!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Innidan 9:19</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Khawa rathuulla nangnichu, Zion Chingtiang khat-um akaring chak Pathian khuopui, marwaan tirton lising lising omna marwaan Jerusalem tiang, ningheiwajei. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Marwaanna inraming injia Pathian salutir ngai karok-ah inchunna khan ningheiwa ejei. Mi rakip chongkatan, halli mi katha ngai ratha puikamintung Pathian diang nangni ningheiwa ejei.<verse eid="HEB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Abel thisen neek-ah katha thisen sarra chong-inkhitna Akathar Inzootna kabool Jisu diang ningheiwa ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Inphut 4:10</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Khawajarra chongkarilpa ama chong kha rangaimak thomaru, insingtheiru. Nuoipilchungnga Pathian chongpui karilpa karangai zootmak mi ngaikhan lei-inthup matormu. marwaanna inphut chongjuokarilpa makheiya angtho thoa eini ninthupthei sikme! <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:22">Suok 20:22</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Khawa phakhan ama rasakhan neipilchung hi aleiminnik, takkha tuunchu ama'n chong-inkhitna aneijei, “Kei'n woikhat inlet-ah neipilchung bit kikanik eleiya, marwaan um kalakanik sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Hiwa chong ngai'n “Woikhat inlet-ah” inthiangnga naminmu khachu inbool phur rakip ngaihi lakanik nooksik khat-um lakhai nooksik eii, kanik kathamak phur rakip kha kumsoot-ah omsik eii.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Khawajarra eini'n innik maksik rengram inkhat kha nimu jarra karok ah minpaakrui. Halli Pathian kha eini'n chile kaya tak-ah, ama malung nimintai nasik lamtiang chubei tho-inlang rokpuirui;<verse eid="HEB 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Eini Pathian chu kaminmang mator mei ka-ang kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Innidan 4:24</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Malung Mintai nasik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Christian ningchang jarra khatli khat inriang chakru.<verse eid="HEB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Ning-inna khuolmi ngaikha katha-ah donnasik ngaidonru. Mi lekkhat in khan inthoa jetleiya marwaan tirton ngaikha kaleidon inom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Inphut 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Tu ka-ang mikhumna-ah kaom ngai khale, nangni um inmanile mikhumna ah kin-om eii tia ngaidonru. Tu ka-ang kapoong ngai khale, nangni um inmani angnga kinpoong eii tia ngaidonru.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Moiruoi hi mi rakip in kaya het rasu, halli sangram ka-engai khan khatli khatdiang inngamnarasu. zool-inthai le omchan kathamak katho ngai khachu Pathian in chong atansik eii.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Sial manuomna khan ningringkhuo kha wai minroonmaru, halli ningnei khan khopru; ajarchu Pathian in aleiti, “Kei'n nangni namathaan nuning, kei'n nangni angtikniteii namasuo nuning.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Innidan 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Josh 1:5</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Eini'n chi leiya, rilrui,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Pumi hi kei nakasanpa eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Kei'n chi nuning.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Tu ka-ang in keidiang ang nathomator nuwame?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Minpkla 118:6</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Nangni diang Pathian chong kanaleirilpi, lamleikakei ngaikha ngaidonru. Inmani'n angtho thoa inleiring, khat-um inleithime tikha ngaidon inlang, inmani ngamna kha zoomru. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Jisu Christa khachu miyanni, wini, halli apha rakip ah in-angrip. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Akatuun lamma inphut nangni minchuna katuunmak rakip ngaikhan lam nakei marase. Bak-in jarra sinadan injui kha emak se-inlang, Pathian riangwai khan eini malung ngarna musik hi atha; hiwa sinadan kajui ngaikha sinadan ngaikhan leisanmak.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Jihudi ngai chubei thona munna sepa katho thiampu ngaikhan eini maichaam munna inpeii dooiphur kha bakthei emak.<verse eid="HEB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Jihudi ngai thiampu kaliankhet khan sangai thisen kha heichoiya Inthiang Khet Mun khan manu ngai dooiphur kha ajuopeii; takkha sapum khachu khawa maichaam tuol khan inleirou. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Levi 16:27</ref></char><verse eid="HEB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Hiwajarra, ama apumtak thisen khan mi ngai manu minthiang nasik ah, khuopui raalkhat tiangkhan Jisu um ithi eii. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Khawajarra, ama injakna tum kaneipui sik-ah, khawa maichaam tuolkhan eini ama koolla sirui. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Ajarchu eini sik-ah hiwa nuoipilchung hin kumsoot khuopui kha neimakmi; khawajarra eini'n akajuosik khuopui kha ni-enchak eii. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Jisu ah inphut eini rokpuina dooiphur kha Pathian diang apha rakip ah pechak rui; hiwahi ama Pumi eii tina murra inrilsuok kutchoi inpe kha eii. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Chuon katha thosik hi manilmaru halli Khatli khat insannaru, ajarchu Pathian malung mintai nasik dooiphur ngaikha hi eii.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Ninglamkakei ngai chong juiru halli inmani nuoiya omru. Inmani'n inchuon thona ajarkha Pathian diang inlapesik ejarra, inmani'n soongmachum leiya ningratha ngai chungnga in-enchak eii. Nangni'n inmani chong ningjui inchu, inmani'n karok ah inchuon inthosik eii; kha emak inchu, malung hoileiya inmani'n khawa chuonkha inthosik eii halli nangni sik-ah anemna omnuni.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Keini sik-ah nanipi chakru. Keini'n inthiangtak ah kase katha jetna malung kinnei kha keini'n kinjet, ajarchu apha rakip ah keini'n akatuun kha thosik kinmanuom. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Halli kei hi Pathian in innot-ah nangnidiang naheitir nasik kheella malung kaluut-ah nanipiru tia kei'n nangnidiang biakna kaheinei.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Nina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Akadai Pathian in kathiya inphut iminringjei eini Pumi Jisu, Kalok khet keelngam Kakhaalpa Jisu thisen khan ajar eya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:20. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jisu thisen; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama thiya inphut na-inphalpina</char></note> hektik kaommak inzootna kha madanna adeengjei. <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Ama lungdou thothei nasik akadai Pathian in nangnisik arei kaom akatha rakip nangnidiang naperase, halli Jisu Christa jarra angme ama malungtaina kha eini chungnga ama'n thorase. Halli Christa diang kumsoot-ah lurna kha erase! Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chong ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ulenai ngai, hiwa masokna chong malung kaluut-ah nangni'n rangaisik hi kei'n biakna kanaheinei; kei'n nangni diangnga kiheimajia hiwa chemajia hi akasei chu emak. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Eini nisuopui Timothy mikhumna ah inphut inmasuojei tihi ningjetsik kamanuom. Ama innot-ah ahongtung inchu, kei amale inruoiya nangni inmupuisik hongkinte.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Pathian mi ngai rakip diang halli nangni lamkakei rakip diang keini inpaakna chong ngaikha leiperu. Italy makheiya kangamna ngai'n inmani inpaakna chong ngaikha nangnidiang inheimasuo.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Pathian riangwai in nangni rakip na-ompui rase.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
